<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}">
<view class="hero activity-hero"><view class="row"><text class="pill light">{{activity.tag}}</text><view class="activity-art {{activity.color}}"><image class="icon" src="/images/ui/{{activity.icon}}.svg"/></view></view><view class="hero-title">{{activity.title}}</view><view class="hero-desc">{{activity.subtitle}}</view><view class="row hero-bottom"><text class="small-text">{{activity.start}} — {{activity.end}}</text><text class="pill light">{{activity.statusLabel}}</text></view></view>
<view class="card section"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">你的每一步，都算数</text><text class="pill">累计 {{activity.days}} 天</text></view><view class="row"><view><text class="progress-number">{{activity.progress}}</text><text class="unit">/ {{activity.days}} 天</text></view><text class="small-text">{{activity.enrolled ? '每天一次，慢慢靠近目标' : '报名后，开启你的挑战'}}</text></view><view class="progress mt"><view class="progress-fill" style="width:{{activity.progressPercent}}%"></view></view><button wx:if="{{!activity.enrolled}}" class="btn mt" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !activity.canEnroll}}" bindtap="enroll">{{activity.canEnroll ? '报名挑战，一起开始 ↗' : activity.statusLabel}}</button><button wx:elif="{{activity.canClaim}}" class="btn mt" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="claim">达标啦，领取我的奖励 ↗</button><button wx:elif="{{activity.claimed}}" class="btn soft mt" data-url="/pages/rewards/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/gift.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>✓ 奖励已领取 · 查看奖励</text></button><button wx:else class="btn soft mt" data-url="/pages/index/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/sun.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>去首页记录今天的坚持 ↗</text></button></view>
<view class="card section reward-detail"><view class="row"><view class="icon-box large gold"><image class="icon" src="/images/ui/gift.svg"/></view><view class="grow"><text class="pill gold">给坚持的你</text><view class="reward-title mt-sm">{{activity.rewardDays}} 天轻动会员体验卡</view><view class="small-text mt-sm">每日 3 次模拟识餐 · 顺延生效</view></view></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="row"><text class="small-text">奖励名额剩余 {{activity.remainingSlots}} 份</text><text class="small-text">已达标者优先占位</text></view><view class="small-text mt-sm">领取截止：{{activity.claimDeadline}}（北京时间）</view></view>
<view class="section"><view class="section-title mb">开始之前，了解一下</view><view class="card rules"><view class="rule"><text class="rule-num">01</text><view class="grow"><view class="title">报名后开始累计</view><text class="caption">先确认城市并报名。活动周期内，报名当日及之后的有效签到计入进度；同一天只计一次，不支持补签。</text></view></view><view class="rule"><text class="rule-num">02</text><view class="grow"><view class="title"><image class="section-symbol" src="/images/ui/gift.svg"/>达标，获得奖励领取机会</view><text class="caption">累计签到 {{activity.days}} 天即达标。名额有限，先达标者先占位；名额用完则不能领取。</text></view></view><view class="rule"><text class="rule-num">03</text><view class="grow"><view class="title">记得在截止前领取</view><text class="caption">每个账号每个活动限领一次。奖励接在现有模拟会员权益后生效，每日额度不累积。</text></view></view></view></view><view class="notice warn section">模拟模式：报名、达标与发奖在本机完成，尚未连接真实后台。</view>
</block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 每一步坚持，都值得被看见</view></view>
